00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:51.809
I used to be an over
seller, a backend seller,

00:15:51.809 --> 00:15:55.110
even you could say a,
oh I hate to say this,

00:15:55.110 --> 00:15:56.140
but a bullshi...

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.511
And, I thought that I
